{
  "$comment": "Asset-extraction manifest for the arcade pixel kit. Each entry crops a rect from a concept image in docs/design-reference/ and writes a PNG under apps/web/src/assets/arcade/. Processed by scripts/extract-arcade-kit.py; regenerate with `python3 scripts/extract-arcade-kit.py`. rect is [x, y, w, h] in source pixels. slice is 9-slice border insets for CSS border-image (omit for whole-image assets). center: 'keep' leaves pixels as extracted, 'flatten' fills the area inside the slice insets with the median color of flattenSample (removes baked text/content so live HTML text can sit there), 'transparent' punches the interior to alpha 0 (frames over live content). displayScale is the intended CSS upscale factor (integer, rendered with image-rendering: pixelated).",
